  m_text: "Spawn Menu :\n\nThe menu to manage and create molecules. It is divided
    in two sections, the add panel and the delete panel. \nIn the add pannel you
    can browse molecules and click on the one you want to make it appear in the scene.\nIn
    the delete pannel you will see all molecules you have in the scene and click
    the ones you want to remove."
